{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 130,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you know that a 10 meter platform diver\ncovers the last seven meters they fall in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3610,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less time than the first three?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5140,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, this also applies to a falling rock…\nbut rocks aren't nearly as good looking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9030,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, by the time a diver (or rock) has\nfallen three meters, they're already going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13000,
    "dDurationMs": 4090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about 17mph, and as they fall farther, they\ncontinue to pick up speed so that they cover"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17090,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the remaining distance in less time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19310,
    "dDurationMs": 4889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now suppose a world record sprinter races\nour olympic diver - that is, Usain Bolt starts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24199,
    "dDurationMs": 3431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ten meters from the finish line, and the diver\nstarts ten meters above it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27630,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who gets there first?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28910,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Bolt's actual running time through the\nfirst 10 meters of his world record was 1.74"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33370,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seconds, while a rock falling 10 meters takes\nonly 1.43 seconds…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37810,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so victory to the rock by a slim margin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39740,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But of course, an olympic diver is NOT a rock,\nand in particular they'll jump upwards off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44160,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the platform - this means they'll be in the\nair for an additional third of a second, or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47850,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a total of about 1.78 seconds before they\nhit the water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51260,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's actually a close race, and Bolt wins\nthe photo finish!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54370,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, while we continue to be amazed by\nhow fast Usain Bolt is, the fact that he could"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58280,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "beat a diver in free fall is more of a reminder\nthat gravity, while a law of nature and thus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62140,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "consistent, doesn't give you a blazing start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63920,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why it's easiest to catch something\nin the first instant after you drop it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66900,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you wait even a second, it'll be 15 feet\ndown and already traveling 20 miles per hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71700,
    "dDurationMs": 11180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bye bye!"
    } ]
  } ]
}
